==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam your UL Legends and/or [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]], if you have [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]], he can crowd-control the boss.

